How to Report & Replace
- Complete Form DS-64 and DS-11 as needed.
- Visit a passport acceptance facility or contact the nearest U.S. embassy/consulate.
- Provide required supporting documents and payment.

Helpful Official Links
- Lost or Stolen Passports (overview): https://travel.state.gov/content/travel/en/passports/need-passport/lost-stolen.html
